e contact details for a later meeting.","short_summary":"A low-commitment way to identify connections beyond the classroom.","evidence_claim":"NMC says student organizations include ambassador programs, honor societies, field-specific professional organizations, leadership, student government, and veterans organizations.","source_url":"https://www.methodistcollege.edu/support-services","source_title":"Student Engagement & Support Services | Nebraska Methodist College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Participation details vary by organization; contact NMC Student Engagement for current opportunities.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"joslyn-art-museum","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Joslyn Art Museum","title":"Make a free Sunday museum visit","subtitle":"Sunday · 2200 Dodge Street, Omaha","notes":"Plan a daytime walk through the permanent galleries, then use one artwork or architectural detail as a shared conversation starter with a new friend.","short_summary":"A no-admission-cost Omaha art outing with regular Thursday evening hours.","evidence_claim":"Joslyn states that everyone is admitted at no cost during regular museum hours and that permanent galleries and most temporary exhibitions are included.","source_url":"https://joslyn.org/visit/visit-detail/","source_title":"The Joslyn Visit Detail | Joslyn Art Museum","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Museum hours listed by Joslyn are Tuesday–Sunday, 10 a.m.–4 p.m., with Thursday hours until 8 p.m.; closed Mondays and major holidays.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"omaha-henry-doorly-zoo-aquarium","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Omaha's Henry Doorly Zoo and Aquarium","title":"Save a da